# Trivy CVE allowlist for the wolf-scanners images.
#
# Each entry is a CVE/GHSA ID, one per line. Every exception must identify an
# owner, a fixed expiry no more than 180 days away, a reason, and its image
# scope. The release workflow validates this metadata before building.
#
# Format:
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN # owner=<team/email>; expires=YYYY-MM-DD; reason=<why accepted>; images=<exact-image-scope-or-all>
#
# The release workflow validates this source and renders a separate plain
# Trivy ignore file for each scanner, fixer, runtime, proposal, and adapter
# image. An exception scoped to one image can therefore never suppress the
# same vulnerability ID in another image.
#
# Re-triaged 2026-10-26 against a CodeQL 2.27.3 image built from current pins
# (latest bundle, published 2026-10-20). The IDs below remain only in
# artifacts GitHub ships inside the CodeQL bundle; no Wolf-side fix exists.
# Six earlier exceptions no longer reproduce and were removed. Short expiry:
# re-check when the next CodeQL bundle ships.
CVE-2026-54512 # owner=scanner-platform; expires=2026-11-25; reason=CodeQL 2.27.3 bundle still ships jackson-databind 2.18.6 helper artifact; images=codeql
CVE-2026-54513 # owner=scanner-platform; expires=2026-11-25; reason=CodeQL 2.27.3 bundle still ships jackson-databind 2.18.6 helper artifact; images=codeql
CVE-2026-39822 # owner=scanner-platform; expires=2026-11-25; reason=CodeQL 2.27.3 bundle still ships Go 1.26.4 stdlib compiled into bundled scc; images=codeql
CVE-2026-26127 # owner=scanner-platform; expires=2026-11-25; reason=CodeQL 2.27.3 bundle still ships .NET 10.0.0 runtime in C# extractor; images=codeql
CVE-2026-26131 # owner=scanner-platform; expires=2026-11-25; reason=CodeQL 2.27.3 bundle still ships .NET 10.0.0 runtime in C# extractor; images=codeql
CVE-2026-47302 # owner=scanner-platform; expires=2026-11-25; reason=CodeQL 2.27.3 bundle still ships .NET 10.0.0 runtime in C# extractor; images=codeql
CVE-2026-50524 # owner=scanner-platform; expires=2026-11-25; reason=CodeQL 2.27.3 bundle still ships .NET 10.0.0 runtime in C# extractor; images=codeql
CVE-2026-50528 # owner=scanner-platform; expires=2026-11-25; reason=CodeQL 2.27.3 bundle still ships .NET 10.0.0 runtime in C# extractor; images=codeql
CVE-2026-50651 # owner=scanner-platform; expires=2026-11-25; reason=CodeQL 2.27.3 bundle still ships .NET 10.0.0 runtime in C# extractor; images=codeql
CVE-2026-57108 # owner=scanner-platform; expires=2026-11-25; reason=CodeQL 2.27.3 bundle still ships .NET 10.0.0 runtime in C# extractor; images=codeql
